    "description": "Christology is the centre of all Christian theology. This course takes students deep into the person and work of Jesus Christ — his two natures, his atoning death, his resurrection, and what his Lordship means for ordinary life in the Philippines. Beginning with the question \"Who is Jesus?\" and ending with \"What does his Lordship demand?\", the course equips students to hold an uncompromising conviction about Christ that is both intellectually grounded and personally transforming.",
