    "description": "The church that does not know its history is condemned to repeat its errors. This course traces the story of Christianity from the early church to the Reformation, equipping young Filipino believers with a deep-rooted faith — one that knows where it came from, why it believes what it believes, and how to guard it in a generation that prizes novelty over substance.",
