            "heading": "7. Summary",
            "html": "<div class=\"detail-table-wrap\"><table class=\"detail-table\"><thead><tr><th>Discipline</th><th>Nature</th><th>Key Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Personal Bible reading</td><td>Daily encounter with God&#x27;s voice</td><td>Psalm 119:9, 11</td></tr><tr><td>Scripture memorisation</td><td>Internalising the Word for daily use</td><td>Matthew 4:1–11</td></tr><tr><td>Preaching</td><td>Corporate hearing under another&#x27;s teaching</td><td>Romans 10:17</td></tr><tr><td>Prayer</td><td>Structured communion; Psalms as school</td><td>Matthew 6:9–13</td></tr><tr><td>Lord&#x27;s Day worship</td><td>Weekly rhythm; rest and assembly</td><td>Deuteronomy 5:12–15</td></tr><tr><td>Lord&#x27;s Supper</td><td>Bodily proclamation of the gospel</td><td>1 Corinthians 11:26</td></tr><tr><td>Fasting</td><td>Physical alignment with spiritual priority</td><td>Matthew 6:16</td></tr><tr><td>Service</td><td>Outward discipline that shapes the heart</td><td>Galatians 6:2</td></tr><tr><td>Simplicity</td><td>Making space for what matters</td><td>Matthew 6:19–21</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "plainText": "| Discipline | Nature | Key Source |\n|-----------|--------|-----------|\n| Personal Bible reading | Daily encounter with God's voice | Psalm 119:9, 11 |\n| Scripture memorisation | Internalising the Word for daily use | Matthew 4:1–11 |\n| Preaching | Corporate hearing under another's teaching | Romans 10:17 |\n| Prayer | Structured communion; Psalms as school | Matthew 6:9–13 |\n| Lord's Day worship | Weekly rhythm; rest and assembly | Deuteronomy 5:12–15 |\n| Lord's Supper | Bodily proclamation of the gospel | 1 Corinthians 11:26 |\n| Fasting | Physical alignment with spiritual priority | Matthew 6:16 |\n| Service | Outward discipline that shapes the heart | Galatians 6:2 |\n| Simplicity | Making space for what matters | Matthew 6:19–21 |"
