    "description": "The Philippines is considered a Christian nation, yet true gospel proclamation is rare. This course equips young adults to understand, articulate, and share the authentic gospel — to distinguish it from its many counterfeits, to explain true conversion, and to develop a personal evangelism approach rooted in the biblical pattern of Paul and suited to the Filipino relational culture.",
