            "heading": "7. Summary",
            "html": "<div class=\"detail-table-wrap\"><table class=\"detail-table\"><thead><tr><th>Concept</th><th>Core Point</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Why confessions matter</td><td>Every community has doctrine; the question is whether it&#x27;s examined and accountable</td></tr><tr><td>Trueman: no creed but the Bible</td><td>Produces unacknowledged theology, not no theology; more dangerous, not less</td></tr><tr><td>Gibson: corporate confession</td><td>Heidelberg Catechism Q&amp;A 1 — teaching, formation, connection, protection</td></tr><tr><td>Miller: corporate prayer</td><td>Vulnerability, shared petition, accountability — the prayer meeting forms community</td></tr><tr><td>1689 Confession</td><td>Comprehensive, historically rooted, Scripture-derived; a foundation for Filipino Reformed Baptist identity</td></tr><tr><td>Confessional church characteristics</td><td>Knows what it believes; confesses together; patient; humble but clear</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "plainText": "| Concept | Core Point |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Why confessions matter | Every community has doctrine; the question is whether it's examined and accountable |\n| Trueman: no creed but the Bible | Produces unacknowledged theology, not no theology; more dangerous, not less |\n| Gibson: corporate confession | Heidelberg Catechism Q&A 1 — teaching, formation, connection, protection |\n| Miller: corporate prayer | Vulnerability, shared petition, accountability — the prayer meeting forms community |\n| 1689 Confession | Comprehensive, historically rooted, Scripture-derived; a foundation for Filipino Reformed Baptist identity |\n| Confessional church characteristics | Knows what it believes; confesses together; patient; humble but clear |"
